Ulanzi D100H → AetherSDR
========================

This repository redistributes and modifies:

    AetherSDR Controller — a Ulanzi Studio plugin
    Copyright (c) Nigel Fenton (G0JKN)
    https://github.com/nigelfenton/aethersdr-ulanzi-plugin
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The plugin is Nigel Fenton's work. Everything in this repository that is
not his is a set of local patches to it, plus probe/deploy tooling, by
Manoj Kumar R (VU2CPL). All of it is offered under the same Apache-2.0
licence — see LICENSE.

Redistributed UNMODIFIED (pristine upstream v0.1.5, kept for diffing):

    upstream-original/README.md
    upstream-original/manifest.json
    upstream-original/plugin/app.js
    upstream-original/property-inspector/keypad/inspector.html
    upstream-original/property-inspector/vfo/inspector.html

Redistributed MODIFIED, per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):

    patched/plugin/app.js
    patched/property-inspector/vfo/inspector.html
    patched/property-inspector/keypad/inspector.html
    patched/manifest.json
    d100h-aethersdr-macbook.zip   (a built bundle containing the above)

Those files carry the fifteen local patches listed in README.md. The three
text files above carry an in-file modification notice; manifest.json does
not, because it is parsed by Ulanzi Studio and a comment key risks breaking
it — its modification is recorded here and in README.md instead.

Some of these patches were contributed back and are now upstream, merged in
nigelfenton/aethersdr-ulanzi-plugin#4. Others are local preference and were
deliberately not offered. README.md says which is which, patch by patch.

The bundled `ws` dependency inside d100h-aethersdr-macbook.zip is MIT
licensed and carries its own LICENSE file within the archive.
